@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Fresh status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/status

### Power ON (verified by readback)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/power
Content-Type: application/json

{"on": true}

### Power OFF (verified by readback)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/power
Content-Type: application/json

{"on": false}

### Normal auto mode
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/auto-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "normal"}

### Night auto mode
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/auto-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "night"}

### Turbo auto mode
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/auto-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "turbo"}

### Manual Silent
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/manual-speed
Content-Type: application/json

{"speed": "silent"}

### Manual Low
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/manual-speed
Content-Type: application/json

{"speed": "low"}

### Manual Mid
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/manual-speed
Content-Type: application/json

{"speed": "mid"}

### Manual High
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/manual-speed
Content-Type: application/json

{"speed": "high"}

### Manual Turbo (distinct from Auto Turbo)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/manual-speed
Content-Type: application/json

{"speed": "turbo"}

### Start pre-filter auto cleaning (requires power ON; no JSON body)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/auto-cleaning

### Smart Search ON (requires power ON)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/smart-search
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": true}

### Smart Search OFF
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purifier/smart-search
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": false}

### OpenAPI specification
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Scalar interactive API reference (open in a browser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/scalar/v1
